{"3795570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Abyss Of Doom", "steam_appid": 3795570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795570/extras/14ba34453b1f17f0ecc85a2b423367fd.avif?t=1780396703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795570/extras_big/14ba34453b1f17f0ecc85a2b423367fd.avif?t=1780396703 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a hybrid of psychological horror and immersive adventure, where you will be plunged into a nightmare that drags you into the depths of the abyss. Journey through medieval dungeons and ancient Roman ruins on your path to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE AND FIGHT TO PRESERVE YOUR SANITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795570/extras/2e639573b4520be09573c68830b231f8.poster.avif?t=1780396703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795570/extras/2e639573b4520be09573c68830b231f8.webm?t=1780396703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795570/extras/2e639573b4520be09573c68830b231f8.mp4?t=1780396703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a hostile world where you must face an inexplicable evil that plunges you into a nightmare. Explore grim locations in search of answers, hide from various enemies, or carve your path by force using whatever you can find. Whether you try to escape or confront your own madness head‑on — the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER THE SECRETS BY EXPLORING ABANDONED LOCATIONS OF DIFFERENT HISTORICAL ERAS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795570/extras/364fae8ceea97e15af788ec6a62def87.poster.avif?t=1780396703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795570/extras/364fae8ceea97e15af788ec6a62def87.webm?t=1780396703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795570/extras/364fae8ceea97e15af788ec6a62def87.mp4?t=1780396703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a search for a mysterious tomb where, after unexpected events, you will find yourself trapped. Journey through abandoned medieval and ancient Roman locations to find treasures or escape. Uncover the terrifying secrets of past events that claimed many lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MAKE DIFFERENT CHOICES, BUT BE PREPARED FOR THE CONSEQUENCES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795570/extras/4a16383e07c35954c62e49fb28715a02.poster.avif?t=1780396703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795570/extras/4a16383e07c35954c62e49fb28715a02.webm?t=1780396703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795570/extras/4a16383e07c35954c62e49fb28715a02.mp4?t=1780396703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare to walk the path of madness and despair, where the chance of survival is slim. Will you make the right decisions, overcoming the challenges, or will you succumb to greed and follow the path of destruction? Face the consequences of your actions in a dynamic world, choosing your own playstyle. </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795570/extras/14ba34453b1f17f0ecc85a2b423367fd.avif?t=1780396703\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795570/extras_big/14ba34453b1f17f0ecc85a2b423367fd.avif?t=1780396703 width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a hybrid of psychological horror and immersive adventure, where you will be plunged into a nightmare that drags you into the depths of the abyss. Journey through medieval dungeons and ancient Roman ruins on your path to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SURVIVE AND FIGHT TO PRESERVE YOUR SANITY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795570/extras/2e639573b4520be09573c68830b231f8.poster.avif?t=1780396703\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795570/extras/2e639573b4520be09573c68830b231f8.webm?t=1780396703\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795570/extras/2e639573b4520be09573c68830b231f8.mp4?t=1780396703\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a hostile world where you must face an inexplicable evil that plunges you into a nightmare. Explore grim locations in search of answers, hide from various enemies, or carve your path by force using whatever you can find. Whether you try to escape or confron